WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.438
In nominal conditions, the refreshed path leads toward the commanded target.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.601
Airflow pushes the drone sideways, creating a position error.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.720
Added mass causes a further vertical error.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:20.127
A virtual target moves. The path is now repeatedly computed toward that virtual target.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.392
As it stabilizes, the drone converges to the original green command, despite the disturbances.
